{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa2439b747c603c620cc0a52fd1e420458386896825bb71e2f8117c533a6f06a",
      "text": "运动系列服装商品广告的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f98760d885e9dd9c84ba46be8a48c7710014123e512595a88d70f01c4f8a73b",
      "text": "悠介先生，辛苦了。\n现在有时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a99343bc719f0c0f993eb1f80aa1b6d14015f0f52174301622c8525be0b6455",
      "text": "辛苦啦！\n完全有空哦，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cdd4671d43203998cd6177c77dae44626f391e7cfd541e5fdb9ccea398aec77",
      "text": "下次工作的样品送过来了，\n想请您确认一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2121bbd40c64430ca6870083d210bf87fc2a9ac312ea249d32d4f4f8d14199f0",
      "text": "下次……啊，服装品牌广告里要用的那个？\n我一直都很期待呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5efdbefa38b9f9e1fb8f0822adf5f544b68579d4c78ff5bd4e73d15a9fed47df",
      "text": "哇！这件内搭手感超级舒服！\n透气性看起来也超棒的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ccd4f0f8f618e877e464d3415f4eef773db101e6b02dd2649b24f9c67b84c2d",
      "text": "不愧是新运动品牌，真有下功夫的感觉！\n我自己都好想要一件啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:859b9c34aa033930a7c0a5270c455fa69bba02576b6bc6c109c7d4a5fcee18e3",
      "text": "呵呵，那份样品是赞助商送给\n悠介先生的，请拿去用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42c4b9cf69e4a417f3a1237267e8fb9105194453fc6c81f3145ee250b562acbd",
      "text": "真的吗！？太棒啦！\n啊，不过发售之后我自己也会去买的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a20524b24a8c5acdf0eba7247683b1545042657b9cdddcab2d27be69ce9bd71",
      "text": "我还想买一件送给享介嘛。\n好的训练服再多也不嫌多！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_01:1_5_012_01:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8dac2630c0a5f06b6d767ddfa95ea8e06a6c16f2675e54f2dfa2742cb812afc",
      "text": "那真不错呢。\n他一定会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
